{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>The Ophel</b> — a high fortress. Likewise: \"the Ophel, daughter of Zion\" [Micah 4:8], and ויעפילו means \"and they raised high.\" And the word אשר is missing from the verse. Thus it is: \"and the Nethinim, who dwell in the Ophel,\" [as if] אשר יושבים — they joined with them."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:59.842240583Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}